    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22495" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνύπετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόνυ, πίπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>falling on the knee</i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνυπτέω</span></b>  (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνυπετέω</span>), <i>to be weak</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνύποντι</span></b>  (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οῦντι</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">:
				ἀσθενοῦντι</span>, Id., and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνύπων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>,
				<i>depressed</i> or <i>weak</i>, Id.</div>
